{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/cf6b399b21a8145ea830a11280ebb7d6.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Quake and 1940s pulp comics, Pulp Action Shotgun a round-based comic boomer shooter. The goal is simple, Survive the endless waves of demons hellbent on taking you down. With your Ol' Reliable Shotgun you will face the oncoming apocalypse alone. The longer you survive the bigger the horde, they will stop at nothing to defeat you, so make it a worthy battle to the death. Your shotgun can be used for more than just killing, as the knockback is strong enough to send you flying. A well placed shot to the ground will open the skies for traversal, but you can't be wasteful with your ammo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive round after round of monsters closing in on your position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend points to open doors, replenish health or restock ammo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets and upgrades that will help turn the odds in your favour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong knockback from shots allows for inventive ways to traverse the map.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/63e053d62ccf3492f703013e9e4dbb28.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the natural blending of pulp comics with the FPS world. The heart and soul of the genre coming from its loud, obnoxious and campy heritage. Before the age of superheroes we had rugged men with nothing to lose. Here you can live the dream of the one man army that fights for the side of good, even when out matched.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.mp4?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/188c85915d6d6bba48d85edd6d812cfa.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is designed around an issue of a comic, with the locations being used so often over the decades that you could name them off by heart. The Amazonian jungle, The decrypted mansion and The filthy streets of the noire city. The birthplace of these timeless backdrops come from the golden age of Pulp, and now you can walk (or better yet kill) in these classic enviorments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.mp4?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/d0bff384bd53d64b07b2c9205852e30d.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would you need anything other than a perfectly powerful Shotgun? The pump action shotgun is the most iconic weapon in the genre. From mob bosses to the cult heroes. A weapon who's blast echoes like a moving cannon and tears both flesh and paper  to shreds. Sure other weapons have range, speed, form factor etc. But they can't match the feeling of a well placed shotgun blast to a demon's centre mass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing better than a Shotgun? TWO SHOTGUNS!!!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.mp4?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/3957f9a285713e55a8368a82b2ca71f3.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/d335b3a60b161b63bb5ffabc95a954f5.avif?t=1759097593\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa