 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong knockback from shots allows for inventive ways to traverse the map.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/63e053d62ccf3492f703013e9e4dbb28.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the natural blending of pulp comics with the FPS world. The heart and soul of the genre coming from its loud, obnoxious and campy heritage. Before the age of superheroes we had rugged men with nothing to lose. Here you can live the dream of the one man army that fights for the side of good, even when out matched.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.mp4?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/188c85915d6d6bba48d85edd6d812cfa.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is designed around an issue of a comic, with the locations being used so often over the decades that you could name them off by heart. The Amazonian jungle, The decrypted mansion and The filthy streets of the noire city. The birthplace of these timeless backdrops come from the golden age of Pulp, and now you can walk (or better yet kill) in these classic enviorments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.mp4?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/d0bff384bd53d64b07b2c9205852e30d.webp?t=1759097593\" width=923 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would you need anything other than a perfectly powerful Shotgun? The pump action shotgun is the most iconic weapon in the genre. From mob bosses to the cult heroes. A weapon who's blast echoes like a moving cannon and tears both flesh and paper  to shreds. Sure other weapons have range, speed, form factor etc. But they can't match the feeling of a well placed shotgun blast to a demon's centre mass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing better than a Shotgun? TWO SHOTGUNS!!!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.poster.avif?t=1759097593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.webm?t=1759097593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_